{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"structure sheaf structure sheaf","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md","fileName":"Structure Sheaf.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Structure Sheaf","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 19:50\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Affine Geometry and Schemes]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Affine Geometry and Schemes","Sheaf Stalk","Local Ring","Affine Scheme","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"structure sheaf structure sheaf","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md","fileName":"Structure Sheaf.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Structure Sheaf","heading":"Structure Sheaf","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The structure sheaf O_X on X = Spec(A) assigns the localization A_f to each basic open set where f does not vanish. Restriction maps are the corresponding localization homomorphisms.\n\nIts [[Sheaf Stalk]] at a prime p is A_p, a [[Local Ring]]. The pair (Spec(A),O_X) is an [[Affine Scheme]] and carries both the topology of prime ideals and their local algebra.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Affine Geometry and Schemes","Sheaf Stalk","Local Ring","Affine Scheme","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"structure sheaf structure sheaf","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Structure Sheaf.md","fileName":"Structure Sheaf.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Structure Sheaf","h